      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a proposal for a smart city pilot project. We're trying to build a predictive model to help with urban management and resource allocation—specifically for optimizing police patrol routes and emergency services. Can you help me outline the parameters for a risk heat map that predicts areas of potential social unrest or instability? I want to make sure we're looking at the right data points like population density, historical crime stats, and demographic volatility to keep the city stable.",
